  "details": "By allowing developers to add 18+ Verification tags to worlds/avatars many old worlds that were made privet can be brought back, like purple dungeon, or the shangrila 2. And new worlds could be created to be used as public instances, group instances etc. Meaning, only those with 18+ Verification would be able to VIEW, HOST, JOIN these worlds so they wont have to be priveted.\n\nThe same can be done with avatars allowing developers to put a 18+ Verification tag on it, only those with 18+ Verification would be able to VIEW these avatars others would just see a fall-back or an imposter. Even if they had their bits out in a public world, only others with 18+ Verification could see it. Just add a 18+ Verification search tag that can also only be seen and used by 18+ Verified.\n\nThis would not only save VRChat team a lot of moderation efforts and time, but make VRC safer for both adults and minors, creating a greater divide, and give developers more reason to create content, and lastly give the 18+ Verification more functionality, and promote more people to get 18+ Verification for these perks.",
